# Play test of Old Mine Islet (CIPlay old_mine_islet, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe.
island Old Mine Islet
# DEEP 10-25 / ABYSS 10-26: the added land moved the land's centre (the recipe's save prints the exact offset)
offset 2.8622 -2.0096
expect step 0
expect title Down the Old Mine

# The yard in front of the mine: the notice, the miner's locker with the head lamp
walk 20 -10 to 21 -19 h=4.9
zone minehead
expect step 1
read Mine notice
expect step 2
open Miner's locker
expect item HeadLight 1
expect step 3

# ABYSS 10-26: Miners' Row (the foreman's note, the lamp puzzle), Copper Knob's headframe, the quarry's pump house, the winch
zone minersrow
read Foreman Dorsey's note
expect step 4
zone expeditioncamp
read Dr. Ruth Calder's field note
expect hidden harlantin
use Row lamp 1
use Row lamp 3
wait 1
expect shown harlantin
open Harlan's tin
zone knobfoot
zone knobtop
expect step 5
open Headframe deck box
expect story windkey 1
expect step 6
zone quarry
expect step 7
open Pump house strongbox
expect story pumpfuse 1
expect step 8
air pumpair
use minewinch
expect story winch 1
expect step 9
expect shown winchchest
open Foreman's box
read Tally book page
# the lamp tallies (a set) and the other secrets
use Lamp tally 1
use Lamp tally 2
use Lamp tally 3
use Lamp tally 4
use Lamp tally 5
wait 1
expect message All five lamp tallies
expect item TitaniumIngot 1
zone greyclaim
open Grey's second claim
open Assay plane's crate
open Ore barge's crate
zone jump_om_finale
open Slag stack prize

# DEEP 10-25: Prospect Hill on the north shore, the prospector's note and cache
zone prospectfoot
zone prospecttop
expect step 10
read Prospector Elias Grey's note
expect step 11
use prospecthatch
expect message The hatch lifts

# Into the mine along the rails: the beast wakes at the deep end
walk 20 -17.4 to 12 -17.4 to 2 -17.4 h=5.2
zone deep
expect message grunts in the dark
expect step 12
kill Warthog
expect step 13
expect animals Warthog 0

# To the end of the line: the last ore cart
walk 2 -17.4 to -8.5 -17.4 h=6.5
open Last ore cart
wait 2
expect item Blueprint_MetalDetector 1
expect done
